  "components": [],
  "timeoriginalestimate": null,
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Description"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Ticking or unticking a technician in the Technician Utilization technician filter sends a fresh request to the server. This filter is meant to work on screen only \u2014 hiding rows and recalculating the Summary \u2014 unlike the location filter, which does reload."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Steps to reproduce"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Environment: QA branch sv8582 (https://sv8582.qa.shopview.com). Desktop browser, signed in as an Admin."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open Reports, then Technician Utilization, and set the date range to This Year."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Open the Technician filter and untick one technician \u2014 Christian Pitts was used here."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Watch the table as the tick comes off. This was seen with the date range This Year (1 January to 6 August 2026), which returns 29 technicians, active location Staging Heavy Duty - 9919, on an account that can also reach Staging Lethbridge - 4310."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Current behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Unticking sends a new request to the report's data address carrying an exclusion list, and the rows come back from the server rather than being hidden in the page."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The outcome is right \u2014 the row count went from 29 to 28 and the Summary recalculated correctly, from 15916.03 / 12843.23 / 3072.80 / 80.7% / $462,687.13 to 14984.33 / 12811.99 / 2172.34 / 85.5% / $332,120.67. It is the reload that is wrong. The location selection was unchanged throughout."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "This is not the same fault as the sorting reload, which is reported separately: that one happens on a column heading click, this one on a filter change."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Expected behaviour"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Changing the technician filter hides and shows the rows already on screen and recalculates the Summary, without asking the server again. Only the location filter reloads the report."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "rule"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Source",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " \u2014 "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "the "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Technician Utilization report specification",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "link",
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020aa00b8d6a71f4259891982a304227c20/pages/641400833/Technician+Utilization+Report"
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " on Confluence, version 6, requirement S9-R3: \u201cSelecting one, several, or all locations reloads the report scoped to that set (unlike the technician filter, which is on-screen only).\u201d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The same description, requirement S4-R5: \u201cExpansion state is view-only and is not persisted: it resets (all collapsed) on any data reload (date-range or location change) and on a fresh visit. Deselecting and re-selecting a technician in the technician filter (an on-screen operation) does not change the expansion state of the other rows.\u201d"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
